  "ingredients": [
    "4 ounce kale sprouts",
    "2 tablespoon parmesan cheese",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Heat the oil or lard in a deep fryer until it's hot. This is the package that I got from Trader Joe's, although I do know that Whole Foods also sells kale sprouts.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fried-kale-sprouts/#wprm-recipe-51587-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_5864.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the kale sprouts in the fryer basket. Try to spread the sprouts out in a single layer.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fried-kale-sprouts/#wprm-recipe-51587-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_6010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sure to close the deep fryer before submerging the basket into the oil. These have a rather high water content, and when water mixes with oil it can be quite violent — some oil splashes will undoubtedly occur.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fried-kale-sprouts/#wprm-recipe-51587-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_6014.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry the kale sprouts until browned on the edges of the bulb and dark green on the leaves.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fried-kale-sprouts/#wprm-recipe-51587-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_6024.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the basket and place on paper towels to drain off any excess grease.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fried-kale-sprouts/#wprm-recipe-51587-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_6028.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season with parmesan cheese, salt, and pepper. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fried-kale-sprouts/#wprm-recipe-51587-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
